{"overview":"یک اسب تک‌شاخ نارنجی و جادویی که توانایی آواز خواندن دارد، گروه بازیگران خود را در بُعدی سورئال شبیه به یک برنامه تلویزیونی گروگان می‌گیرد. این اسب تک‌شاخ به مرور زمان رفتارهای عجیبی از خود نشان می‌دهد و فضای داستان را به سمت ناشناخته‌ها سوق می‌دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Inside the colorful world of \"It's Buddy!\", a group of children spend their days singing, dancing, and helping Buddy - bright orange unicorn - spread happiness. But when one child refuses to play along, Buddy is not pleased and cracks begin to appear in this seemingly perfect world.","tagline_en":"It's Buddy!","runtime":96,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Casper Kelly"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","IL"],"cast":[{"name":"کیگان-مایکل کی","role":"Buddy / Dark Buddy (voice)","photo":"/xmdzYXP9j87a43FSiL138nLesuS.jpg","en":"Keegan-Michael Key"},{"name":"Delaney Quinn","role":"Freddy","photo":"/byBPP7Zg4NKQEejOBme9PUdRAZp.jpg"},{"name":"Tristan Borders","role":"Oliver","photo":"/sSXJnfhtw8CbFJKRwd3cMEdhFAq.jpg"},{"name":"Madison Skyy Polan","role":"Hannah","photo":"/9O5EsUmfrr4uHvjFV9sJJFg900g.jpg"},{"name":"Caleb Williams","role":"Wade","photo":"/6I6wWh2dDYziQhqncAT0isaDGoY.jpg"},{"name":"کریستین میلیوتی","role":"Grace","photo":"/aiOOWmej3qYSiR9cUs3lm5x5SkB.jpg","en":"Cristin Milioti"},{"name":"توفر گریس","role":"Ben","photo":"/89sF57Br5lq8nrepS7HLzJ41QD1.jpg","en":"Topher Grace"},{"name":"پتن اسوالت","role":"Strappy (voice)","photo":"/ljQvjbPmcIAl205Lb2Mu4CW8WO7.jpg","en":"Patton Oswalt"},{"name":"مایکل شنون","role":"Willie (voice)","photo":"/6mMczfjM8CiS1WuBOgo5Xom1TcR.jpg","en":"Michael Shannon"},{"name":"Clint Howard","role":"George","photo":"/qC7AgKmcBFk76ojTYELeirw1viQ.jpg"},{"name":"Bennie Taylor","role":"Mailman Miles","photo":"/dFGThwEI8aGjqMSLHZQJ80sjmrm.jpg"},{"name":"Phuong Kubacki","role":"Nurse Nancy","photo":"/uUgZ9EhaUJaxWhHoqPBZp3mGAhz.jpg"}],"trailer":"Pc9MbCNYn3k","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1514026-buddy/wat